  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Capacity for the Reception and Management of Persons in Need of International Protection in Mauritius</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNHCR aims to support the Government of Mauritius to establish a nationally owned protection  management system, emphasizing sustainability, responsibility-sharing, and self-reliance, and the strategy will ensure the protection space for those in need, disincentivize applications from those without international protection needs, and safeguard national security.</narrative>
  </description>
